## 2. The Abstract-to-Concrete Translation Matrix

Use this dictionary to convert vague client adjectives into technical visual parameters:

| Vague Descriptor | Underlying Design Style | AI Trigger Keywords & Visual Specifics |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| *"Clean / Minimal"* | Bauhaus / Utilitarian / Japandi | Asymmetric balance, strict grid system, unornamented grotesque sans-serif, high negative space, raw matte finishes. |
| *"Dreamy / Soft"* | Ethereal / Aurora / Light Academia | Subsurface scattering, gauzy ray-traced volume lights, low-contrast feathered shadows, chromatic bloom, pastel wash. |
| *"Futuristic"* | Cybercore / Synthwave / Neo Frutiger Aero | Luminescent fiber-optics, hard-surface glass, specular highlights, dark mode with neon accents, volumetric fog. |
| *"Luxury / High-End"* | Neoclassical / Art Deco / Luxury Typography | High letter-spaced Didone serifs, brushed brass, veined Carrara marble, deep chiaroscuro, gold foil stamping. |
| *"Edgy / Raw"* | Brutalism / Neo-Brutalism / Graffiti | Monospaced typography, exposed canvas grids, heavy black structural borders (`border: 3px solid #000`), xerox distortion. |
| *"Nostalgic"* | Y2K / Vaporwave / Mid-Century | Chromatic aberration, VHS scanlines, halftone dot rasterization, warm Kodachrome 64 color profile. |

